<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Mɛkana ɛ Zuud</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Zuud</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zuud</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Zuud</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zuud</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak, Zuud ɛ nakwyal yɛ. Zuud ɛ dhyeeb ɛ Zak bɛ nɛ Yezu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyɛ nakwyal mɛkana mɛ tak ɛ étɛp ekeletyɛ djas. Tɔ mɛkana mak, Zuud ɛpedul ekeletyɛ mɛlɔ dum nɛ mbee mɛlyo mɛ di àànɔŋel nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ. Mbee mɛfulu mɔɔ ɛpelyaal náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ dinaa, bɛ ààdum koŋ nɛ Yezu ɔ. Nyɛ ɛpebaalyaal dáa Zɛɛb aawa bot ɛ di esa embee mɛsa e feŋ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ mɛkana mak, Zuud ɛpenɔɔ etɛp ee nasael eghɛŋ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa, étɛp nyɛ neelyo ekeletyɛ e mɛlu mak. Bhaadal ɛ Zuud ɛpenɔŋel nɛ mɛkana mɛ bɔɔba ɛ Pyɛɛd.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ Zuud ɛ nɛ ghwyil di nɛ mɛtsek mɛtɛn nɛ ebá:</para>
  <para style="io">Mɛswosel (1-2)</para>
  <para style="io">Zuud ɛpedul ekeletyɛ mɛlɔ dum nɛ embee mɛlyo (3-16)</para>
  <para style="io">Dáa Zuud di edjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ ekeletyɛ, étɛp bɛ needi ghiŋ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, dɔɔ nɛ Yezu Klisto mɛtsik bot'enaka (17-23)</para>
  <para style="io">Duu nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik (24-25).</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam Yude, kwom e mɛsa ɛ Yezu Klisto, mɔn nyɛɛg ɛ Zak. Mɛ kwyal ɛ biyɔ mɛkana mak, biyɔ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazedjóo ɔ, biyɔ bot ɛ Zɛɛb sɛɛg di ekwyɛl ɔ, biyɔ bot ɛ Yezu Klisto di ebaal ɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb djɛ bin bɛtɛ nɛ lyem ghoŋ, egwyem nɛ kwyɛl.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbee bɛlyoel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Bɔɔ nyaag'am mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛkwyal bin mɛkana kɔ ɛsu ɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm Zɛɛb natsik mena ɛ, deenek, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak étɛp ɛdjɛ bin mɛghaaz, bi needuu tuub étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb nazedjɛaa kɔm-kɔm nɛ bot ɛ nadɛɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Tin, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ na mbee mɛpek eezeni tɔ len syaab. Bɛ ɛpeliig sa enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Zɛɛb'ena di elɛɛ ɛ, étɛp bɛ neediyal mɛnyel dum nɛ embee mɛfulu mɔɔ. Deenek, bɛ eelum koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto sim Ghɛŋ'enaka, sim lyoel'enaka. Tin, ekwyala naazelolɛɛ mbi feŋ di ebwood bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Bela náá, bi eezegu etɛp binek djas ɛnyɔɛpe. Deenek, mɛ kaada bin ɛ dáa Ghɛŋ natsik bɔɔ Yisalaɛl pɛ kyee dik Eziptɛ ɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ naazɛgó bot ɛ nadi ààdum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Baataalaka dɔɔ nɛ efofop nadi ààkwyɛl ɛdi e edi Zɛɛb nanɛɛg bɛ ɔ, bɔɔ ɛ batadus edi bɛ nadidi ɔ. Wɔ gwaa, Zɛɛb zɛnɔɔ bɛ, kɔl bɛ nɛ ekel eghwooz kɔm-kɔm. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdiyal bɛ tɔ ghooghom kɛkum e boo dwoo epɛ́ɛ bɔɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Taalaka dɔɔ nɛ eghaada Sodɔm nɛ Ghomɔɔd, zɛnɔɔ eghaada nadi e mengwoob ɛ: bot ɛ eghaada tak nadi ɛ́ nɛ embee mɛfulu dáa efofop binɔk, bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ mbee mɛzɔ, nɛ dhiiti mɛzel mɛ ɛdi ɛbá ee Zɛɛb di ààkwyɛl náá, ye sael ɛ. Tin, bɛ ɛ́ tɔ feŋ du na kɔm-kɔm. Yenek ɛ, dáa Zɛɛb dul menabɛlka djas mɛlɔ ɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Bot ɛ nazeni tɔ len syaab ɔ, ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ bɛ dyeebasa. Nɛ mbee esimza bɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ, bɛ ɛpesyem nɛ mɛnyel mɔɔ, bɛ ɛpebyasal eghɛŋ Zɛɛb, bɛ ɛpenyek duma efofop di tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Tin, konyel Mesɛl kukuma efofop nabɛ ɛ́ ààkosa yɛ. Tɔ ɛwɔ bɛ nɛ satan, e sok bɛ nadi esuu muu ɛ Moiiz ɛ, fofop Mesɛl nabɛ ɛ́ ààkolee nyɛ, nyɛ nazoke nɛ nɛ ɛ náá: «beta náá, Ghɛŋ wa wɔ e feŋ!» <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Bot binɔk lee ɛ sa bɛ di ààgu ɛ, sa bɛ di egu ɛ, bɛ gu ye ɛ́ dáa bɛtit, bot ɛ di ààtiibal ɔ, ye ɛ́ etɛp binek ɛ di esa náá, bɛ wo ze.<verse eid="JUD 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>«Ha!» Kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nɔɔ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ naadu ko ɛ Kayin, bɛ eewo ze dáa Bhalaam etɛp epata. Tin, bɛ nagwyɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá bɛ naalyel elo dáa Koole.<verse eid="JUD 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di ekus ɛghuub, e sok bi di tɔ zɛɛga ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛdɛ edee bi nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bin ɛ. E di'enek, bɛ bɔl ɛbyoŋ ɛ, ààbis mot, ààbɛ nɛ syen, bɛ ɛ́ dáa eguud di ewo tɔ gwoo nɛ pup ɛ, tin bhi kadi ɛ́ àànee. Bɛ ɛ́ dáa ele di ààwum ɛ ye nakoozodi e mbu di egoka nɛ ɛwum ɛ. Tin, yɛ guaa ɔɔ, yɛ waabaagwyɛ, gwyɛa sis. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Deenek, bɛ ɛ́ tyee bhuuge boo dii mɛsɔn di dheegel ɛbuɛpe ɛ, bɛ wyisal embee mɛfulu mɔɔ ɛ «pwaleŋ» e mis mɛ bot dáa boo dii mɛsɔn dyeebawyisal eput esonok di emwasaa tɔ tak ɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ dhatyee ekwyikwyen di ewo dáa ɛghwak tɔ mɛdii ɛ. Tin, tɔ di mɛghomla, Zɛɛb naazekoobal bɛ di na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Enɔk, bhaab'enaka yii etɛn nɛ ebá bhis Adam, naaloolɛɛ náá: «Beeka, Ghɛŋ ɛpezyɛ alu nɛ alu nɛ efofop bɛ nadɛɛ, <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>étɛp ɛzɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas. Tin, nyɛ waakwyesal bot ɛ mesyem ndjɛ sɔs, kɔ ɛsu ɛ embee mɛsa mɔɔ ee bɛ nasa nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Dɔɔ nɛ embee mɛkpa mɛ bot ɛ mesyem di ààkaab bot ɔ nalelóo nyɛ ɛ́.» <verse eid="JUD 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Bot binɔk, tok nɛ mɛmyaala tɔ elyem bɔɔ, mɛsa mɔɔ ɛ etaŋal, bɛ kɛ ɛ́ dáa elyem bɔɔ di ekwos ɛ. Bɛ lii nɛ bot ɛ nɛ ɛbet, bɛ nɛ sa mɛkɔŋ kɔ elo e bot, étɛp bɛ neebela sa bɛ di esaŋ ɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdul ɛ mɛlɔ nɛ lwomel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔ, bɔɔ nyaag'am mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, taalaka mɛkpa mɛ bot ɛ lwoma ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto nagoola bin ɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eelɛɛ nɛ nen náá: «e mɛsik mɛ bɔs, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ bot aawyii bin, bɛ aazodi ekɛ ɛ tɔ mbee mɛkwosak mɛ elyem bɔɔ.» <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Bɛ ɛ́ binɔk, bot ɛ ɛzɛm, bot ɛ di ewa mbɛk ɔ, bɛ tok nɛ sisim ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ lɔɔ, bɛ kɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ epuud bɔɔ tyee bɛtit.<verse eid="JUD 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bɔɔ nyaag'am mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, saka náá, tsik'en kɛkɔ e dɛɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ len nɛ Zɛɛb, Djaalaka nɛ mɛbwala mɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Waka lyem tɔ kwyɛl ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp ɛbwood dwoo Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto aadjɛ mena tsik na kɔm-kɔm kɔ ɛsu ɛ lyem ghoŋ'ɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Dika nɛ ghoŋ nɛ bot ɛ di ekaab ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>Deenek, ye ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ dinaa, bi ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ tsik bɛ e ɛwyisal ɛ bɛ tɔ du epɛ́ɛ ɔ. Yɛ kabɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɔ, dika nɛ lyem ghoŋ nɛ nɔɔ, dika nɛ etsoŋ, eghɛŋ bi nɛ bɛ nɔɔ ɛdi edi wat ɔ, ekaab náá, bɛ ɛzɛkɛful bin elo nɛ mbee mɛfulu mɔɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duu e mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Dum nɛ mot di ebaal bin étɛp bi needi ààsyem, mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛ baadis bin mesyem etɛɛ náá, bi needi dɛɛ, nɛ mɛmyaala tɔ duma yɛ, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>nɛ sim Zɛɛb'enaka ngɔt, mɛtsik-bot menaka, kɔ lo ɛ Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'enaka. Beta náá, duma, nɛ mɛbwala, nɛ ngek'ɛ dɔɔ nɛ ekukuma bɛ, di nɛ nɛ nenak, kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! Ye di deenek!<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
